            "raw_response_preview": "```json\n{\n  \"facts\": {\n    \"defendants\": [\n      \"Phạm Bá D\",\n      \"Phạm Hải N\"\n    ],\n    \"conduct\": \"Phạm Bá D and Phạm Hải N conspired to commit robbery. On July 1, 2023, Phạm Hải N drove a Honda AirBlade motorcycle to approach the victim, Lee Chang Ho, while Phạm Bá D sat behind and snatched an iPhone 11 from the victim's hand. They subsequently sold the phone for 2,000,000 VND and used the money for personal spending and gaming.\",\n    \"dates\": [\n      \"2023-07-01\",\n      \"2023-07-02\",\n    ",
