            "response_repr": "ChatCompletion(id='gen-1781213987-2GJEooBPMcLb9oXwhFla', choices=[Choice(finish_reason='stop', index=0, logprobs=None, message=ChatCompletionMessage(content='```json\\n{\\n  \"facts\": {\\n    \"defendants\": [\\n      \"Nguyễn Thị T\"\\n    ],\\n    \"conduct\": \"Nguyễn Thị T, while working as a sales employee at D2 Joint Stock Company, misappropriated 364,630,000 VND collected from 12 customers for 29 orders for personal use. Additionally, she used her own company (Company V) and old customer information to create 20 orders (totaling 671,225,000 VND) to supply to Company T6 for a profit of 50,000 VND/cubic meter, which resulted in a debt to Company D2 as Company T6 has not paid. She also caused loss for 5 orders (113,670,000 VND) due to pump truck incidents.\",\\n    \"dates\": [\\n      \"From May 2022 to August 2022\"\\n    ],\\n    \"victims\": [\\n      \"Công ty cổ phần D2\"\\n    ],\\n    \"property_value\": \"364,630,000 VND (misappropriated), 671,225,000 VND (unpaid orders), 113,670,000 VND (damaged orders)\",\\n    \"harm\": \"Financial loss to Công ty cổ phần D2 due to misappropriation of funds and unpaid orders.\",\\n    \"admissions\": \"Nguyễn Thị T admitted her wrongdoing, expressed regret, and confessed honestly.\",\\n    \"prior_convictions\": \"No prior convictions or criminal records.\",\\n    \"mitigation_signals\": [\\n      \"Honest confession\",\\n      \"Repaid 100,000,000 VND to remedy the consequences\",\\n      \"No prior convictions\"\\n    ],\\n    \"aggravation_signals\": [],\\n    \"stated_facts\": [\\n      \"Nguyễn Thị T is a sales employee of Công ty cổ phần D2.\",\\n      \"Between May 2022 and August 2022, she created 54 orders (1,002.5 cubic meters of concrete, valued at 1,149,525,000 VND).\",\\n      \"She collected 364,630,000 VND from 12 customers for 29 orders and kept it for personal use.\",\\n      \"She used Company V and old customer info to create 20 orders (totaling 671,225,000 VND) for C