 VND\",\\n      \"Trần Phú C1\\'s wife returned 13,390,000 VND\",\\n      \"Nguyễn Thị P returned 2/3 of the illegal proceeds\",\\n      \"Phạm Văn V\\'s father is a revolutionary contributor\"\\n    ],\\n    \"aggravation_signals\": [\\n      \"Organized nature of the crime (Nguyễn Thanh N as the organizer)\",\\n      \"Large volume of minerals extracted (21,676 m³)\",\\n      \"Operating at night to evade detection\"\\n    ],\\n    \"stated_facts\": [\\n      \"Nguyễn Thanh N used boat HNa-0278 to mine sand without a license\",\\n      \"Mining occurred from 18:00 to 03:00\",\\n      \"Nguyễn Thị P bought 13,320 m³ of sand\",\\n      \"Trần Phú C1 bought 4,070 m³ of sand\",\\n      \"Phạm Văn V, Bùi Văn T2, Phan Văn H3, and Đoàn Văn V2 were paid 500,000 VND per trip\",\\n      \"Caught red-handed on 12/12/2023 with 216 m³ of sand on board\"\\n    ],\\n    \"inferred_facts\": [\\n      \"The group operated as a coordinated ring with a clear division of labor (organizer, operators, buyers).\",\\n      \"The scale of the operation is significant based on the total value exceeding 3 billion VND.\"\\n    ],\\n    \"missing_facts\": [\\n      \"Specific environmental damage assessment report\",\\n      \"Whether the sand mining occurred in a protected area or specific restricted zone\"\\n    ]\\n  },\\n  \"candidates\": [\\n    {\\n      \"Dieu\": \"227\",\\n      \"Khoan\": \"2\",\\n      \"Diem\": null,\\n      \"offence_name\": \"Tội vi phạm quy định về nghiên cứu, thăm dò, khai thác khoáng sản\",\\n      \"search_query\": \"Điều 227 Bộ luật Hình sự 2015 khai thác khoáng sản trái phép\",\\n      \"supporting_facts\": \"Illegal extraction of 21,676 m³ of sand without a license, total value of minerals extracted is 3,424,808,000 VND.\",\\n      \"rejection_or_downgrade_reason\": null\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \"Dieu\": \"180\",\\n      \"Khoan\": null,\\n      \"Diem\": null,\\n      \"offence_name\": \"Tội tiêu thụ tài sản do người khác phạm tội mà có\",\\n      \"sear