 Medal.\",\\n      \"CÀ VĂN H: Sincere confession, multiple commendations from District P, Provincial Inspectorate, and Labor Union, Government Inspectorate commemorative medal, father was a fire-line civilian worker, grandfather awarded First Class Resistance Medal.\",\\n      \"TRIỆU VĂN T3: Sincere confession, former teacher with many achievements, Emulation Soldier (2005-2007), commendations from Provincial Labor Union and District P, father awarded Third Class Resistance Medal.\"\\n    ],\\n    \"aggravation_signals\": [\\n      \"The defendants used their official positions as inspectors to conceal violations.\",\\n      \"NGUYỄN XUÂN N acted as the leader (Head of the inspection team) directing subordinates to falsify reports.\"\\n    ],\\n    \"stated_facts\": [\\n      \"NGUYỄN XUÂN N was the Head of the inspection team.\",\\n      \"CÀ VĂN H and TRIỆU VĂN T3 were members of the inspection team.\",\\n      \"The team discovered 198,441,000 VND was used incorrectly.\",\\n      \"122,143,000 VND was borrowed by Ms. Nguyễn Thị N3 to build a house.\",\\n      \"NGUYỄN XUÂN N directed the removal of the misappropriation details from the final report and conclusion.\",\\n      \"CÀ VĂN H and TRIỆU VĂN T3 complied with the direction to omit the violations.\",\\n      \"Conclusion 02/KL-UBND was issued without a recommendation for prosecution.\"\\n    ],\\n    \"inferred_facts\": [\\n      \"The defendants\\' actions led to the failure of the state to prosecute a potential crime of misappropriation or embezzlement of state funds.\"\\n    ],\\n    \"missing_facts\": [\\n      \"Whether there was any bribery or personal benefit received by the defendants in exchange for concealing the violations.\",\\n      \"The specific internal regulations of the inspection team regarding the reporting of criminal signs.\"\\n    ]\\n  },\\n  \"candidates\": [\\n    {\\n      \"Dieu\": \"359\",\\n      \"Khoan\": null,\\n      \"Diem\": null,\\n      \"offence_name\": \"Tội thiếu trách nhiệm gây hậu quả nghiêm trọng\",\\n      \"search_query\": \"Tội thiếu trách nhiệm gây hậu quả nghiêm trọng Điều 359 BLHS\",\\n      \"supporting_facts\": \"The defendants failed to perform their duties as inspectors by omitting serious violations from the final report, leading to the failure to prosecute a crime.\",\\n      \"rejection_or_downgrade_reason\": null\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \"Dieu\": \"360\",\\n      \"Khoan\": null,\\n      \"Diem\": null,\\n      \"offence_name\": \"Tội lợi dụng chức vụ, quyền hạn trong khi thi hành công vụ\",\\n      \"search_query\": \"Tội lợi dụng chức vụ quyền hạn trong khi thi hành công vụ Điều 360 BLHS\",\\n      \"supporting_facts\": \"NGUYỄN XUÂN N used his position as Head of the team to direct subordinates to falsify reports to protect others (Ms. N3 and Mr. A).\",\\n      \"rejection_or_downgrade_reason\": \"This requires proof of \\'causing damage\\' or \\'seeking personal benefit\\', which is less clear than the failure of duty.\"\\n    }\\n  ],\\n  \"mitigation_factors\": [\\n    \"NGUYỄN XUÂN N has a sincere confession and repentance.\",\\n    \"NGUYỄN XUÂN N has received multiple commendations from the Chairman of District P and the Provincial Inspectorate.\",\\n    \"NGUYỄN XUÂN N\\'s father was awarded the First Class Resistance Medal.\",\\n    \"CÀ VĂN H has a sincere confession and repentance.\",\\n    \"CÀ VĂN H has received multiple commendations from District P, the Provincial Inspectorate, and the District Labor Union.\",\\n    \"CÀ VĂN H received a commemorative medal from the Government Inspectorate.\",\\n    \"CÀ VĂN H\\'s father was a fire-line civilian worker and his grandfather was awarded the First Class Resistance Medal.\",\\n    \"TRIỆU VĂN T3 has a sincere confession and repentance.\",\\n    \"TRIỆU VĂN T3 was an Emulation Soldier for two consecutive years (2005-2007).\",\\n    \"TRIỆU VĂN T3 received a commendation from the Provincial Labor Union of Province B in 2023.\",\\n    \"TRIỆU VĂN T3